    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About and licences</string>
    <string name="about_text">Brasscribe Play is a non-commercial project. It uses alphaTab (MPL-2.0) for notation and playback with the Sonivox SoundFont (Apache-2.0), sfizz (BSD-2-Clause) for realistic sound, Oboe (Apache-2.0) for audio, ONNX Runtime (MIT) and SwiftF0 (MIT) for on-device pitch detection. Full-band transcription on the companion engine uses MuScriptor (CC BY-NC 4.0), downloaded with your own Hugging Face account.</string>
